{"id": "68510", "title": "盛宠千金空姐", "author": "夏凉冬", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 51, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/68/68510.htm", "intro": "第一次初见，她以一吻换回姐姐的至宝。第二次见面，他在她的航班上亲密唤她。第三次再见，他是公司的新机长，也是她的未婚夫。他是町盛航空英俊帅气的机长先生，町氏的唯一继承人。倾慕他的美女无数，却从没有一人入的他眼。她是名门权贵之后，町盛航空的最美空姐。却始终守着一颗心，念念不忘着一人。爱情没有如果，彼此相遇的那一刻，注定沉沦。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68510", "chapters": [{"title": "001初见", "file": "10533275.html", "available": false}, {"title": "002飞往伦敦", "file": "10533276.html", "available": false}, {"title": "003亲密关系", "file": "10533277.html", "available": false}, {"title": "004坦言", "file": "10533278.html", "available": false}, {"title": "005重遇", "file": "10533279.html", "available": false}, {"title": "006新机长", "file": "10533280.html", "available": false}, {"title": "007是他", "file": "10533281.html", "available": false}, {"title": "008瞩目", "file": "10533282.html", "available": false}, {"title": "009相亲", "file": "10533283.html", "available": false}, {"title": "010未婚妻", "file": "10533284.html", "available": false}, {"title": "011调班", "file": "10533285.html", "available": false}, {"title": "012识破", "file": "10533286.html", "available": false}, {"title": "013彩虹", "file": "10533287.html", "available": false}, {"title": "014同住", "file": "10533288.html", "available": false}, {"title": "015了解", "file": "10533289.html", "available": false}, {"title": "016醉言", "file": "10533290.html", "available": false}, {"title": "017耐心", "file": "10533291.html", "available": false}, {"title": "018生病", "file": "10533292.html", "available": false}, {"title": "019回去", "file": "10533293.html", "available": false}, {"title": "020高调", "file": "10533294.html", "available": false}, {"title": "021茫然", "file": "10533295.html", "available": false}, {"title": "022画展", "file": "10533296.html", "available": false}, {"title": "023不安", "file": "10533297.html", "available": false}, {"title": "024了解", "file": "10533298.html", "available": false}, {"title": "025以后跟他飞", "file": "1